--  Proof project: the SPARK-owned core, proved on its own.
--
--  This project exists because `gnatprove -P iris_wm.gpr` proves nothing today.
--  The compositor's main is still `null`, so nothing references
--  Iris.Geometry or Iris.Placement, so neither unit is in the compile closure,
--  so gnatprove reports "no checks generated" and exits 0. A gate built on
--  that would pass while proving nothing at all.
--
--  Consequences, both deliberate:
--
--    * The proof job needs no wlroots, no Wayland, no GPU. It is pure Ada
--      arithmetic, so CI can run it in a small image instead of the
--      debian:experimental container used for the build.
--    * Adding a new SPARK unit means adding its body to this list. That is a
--      feature: a unit that is not listed is not proved, and the gate says so.
--
--  No `package Compiler` block here, on purpose. gnatprove 16.1.0 crashes with
--  a GNAT BUG DETECTED ("unexpected character '/'") when this project passes
--  the style switches that iris_wm.gpr uses. It is reproducible in a clean
--  debian:bookworm-slim container with `alr install gnatprove=16.1.0`, and it
--  disappears when the switch block is removed. Style checking belongs to the
--  build job; the proof job is about proofs.
--
--  Usage:
--    gnatprove -P tests/spark_proofs.gpr --mode=all --level=4 \
--              --proof=per_check:all

project Spark_Proofs is

   --  Only the two source directories that hold SPARK units. `config/` is
   --  deliberately absent: it is generated by `alr build`, so a fresh clone
   --  does not have it, and including it makes the proof job fail before it
   --  starts with "is not a valid directory". The SPARK core depends on no
   --  generated configuration — that is part of why it is provable.
   for Source_Dirs use
     ("../src/iris/", "../src/iris/wlroots/");

   for Object_Dir use "../obj/spark";
   for Create_Missing_Dirs use "True";

   --  Every SPARK-owned body, listed explicitly. Only these are proved.
   for Main use
     ("iris-geometry.adb",
      "iris-placement.adb");

end Spark_Proofs;
